## Isolate

- What changed since the last green run: `git diff {{last_green_ref}}`, `git log -p -- <path>`.
- Smallest failing case: narrow the input, the path, the data.
- Regressions: `git bisect run <failing command>` (clean tree only).
- Callers and call paths: {{tracing_tool}} <!-- GEN: e.g. GitNexus context/query, rg -n "<symbol>" -->

## Hypothesize

One at a time; write each down:

```
H1: <suspected cause> → check: <command or read> → result: confirmed | ruled out
```

Change one variable per check. When a hypothesis is confirmed, ask "why" again until you reach the defect, then look for the same mistake elsewhere in the diff.

